  // Game: Nestcliff Harbor is a regular destination once 114 is read; 115-119 play there. Smoked fish and
  // lamp oil are its specialties. Eve (and her daughters, as playroom guests) stay at Fair Tide from 120
  // until both 122 and the archive scene (121) are read. No fight: the griffin is never an enemy.
  // Tribute (not built here): 116-118 are a short investigation for the once-per-day search flow; 121
  // supports File 5 (Lost Ownership) by explaining why the two copies count as one source and where the
  // trail currently ends. Those live in Tribute.
  // Pronouns: Aisyah (she), Joel (he), Levi (he), San, Jade, Sally, Eve, Fen, Mimi (she), Adrian (he),
  // the griffin (she); none for the pilot, the yard keeper, the harbor master, the net-mender and the fishers.
